<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tower Semi upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tower Semi upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Andrew Neff said he upgraded Tower Semiconductor Ltd to a buy from an attactive rating.</p>
<p>-- said upgrade based on improving fundamentals and lower stock price.</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 earnings estimate to $0.75 a share from $0.50, compared with $0.83 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- raised 1998 earnings estimate to $1.00 from $0.80.</p>
</text>
